### =========================================================================
### AVAILABILITY (Personal Calendar View & Multi-User Aggregated View)
### =========================================================================

### 3.1 Get User Availability / Calendar View - Success (200 OK)
GET http://{{host}}/api/v1/availability/users/1
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.test("Status code is 200 OK", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200 but got " + response.status);
    });
    client.test("User object present", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.user.id === 1);
    });
%}

### 3.2 Get User Availability with Time Range Filter - Success (200 OK)
GET http://{{host}}/api/v1/availability/users/1?startTime=2026-11-15T00:00:00Z&endTime=2026-11-15T23:59:59Z
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.test("Status code is 200 OK", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200 but got " + response.status);
    });
%}

### 3.3 Get User Availability - Error: User Not Found (404 Not Found)
GET http://{{host}}/api/v1/availability/users/999999
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.test("Status code is 404 Not Found", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 404, "Expected 404 but got " + response.status);
    });
%}

### 3.4 Get Aggregated Availability Across All Users - Success (200 OK)
GET http://{{host}}/api/v1/availability/aggregate?startTime=2026-11-15T00:00:00Z&endTime=2026-11-15T23:59:59Z
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.test("Status code is 200 OK", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200 but got " + response.status);
    });
%}

### 3.5 Get Aggregated Availability Filtered by Specific Users & freeOnly=true - Success (200 OK)
GET http://{{host}}/api/v1/availability/aggregate?startTime=2026-11-15T00:00:00Z&endTime=2026-11-15T23:59:59Z&userIds=1,2&freeOnly=true
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.test("Status code is 200 OK", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200 but got " + response.status);
    });
%}

### 3.6 Get Aggregated Availability - Error: Missing Required Query Parameter (400 Bad Request)
# startTime and endTime are required for aggregated calculations
GET http://{{host}}/api/v1/availability/aggregate
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.test("Status code is 400 Bad Request", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 400, "Expected 400 when missing timeframe parameters");
    });
%}
